From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lef <me@lefteros.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 06:45:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: serial: samsung: add google,zuma-uart

The zuma UART, for the APM USI1 UART that the Pixel 8 Pro's Bluetooth
chip sits on (0x155d0000).

Signed-off-by: Lef <me@lefteros.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml
index e85a83e57..e07a3266e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - google,gs201-uart
+              - google,zuma-uart
               - google,zumapro-uart
               - samsung,exynos2200-uart
           - const: google,gs101-uart
